window.products.push({"id":145212,"name":"SIMOE Countertop Ice Maker, 33lbs/24 Hours Ice Maker for Countertop, Self-Cleaning Function, 12 Ice Cubes in 8 Mins, Ice Cube Machine with Ice Scoop &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b5yRvlFsL._SL1200_.jpg","description":"If you've ever hosted a cocktail party, you know how important ice can be. Once your supply dwindles, even freezers equipped with ice makers are unlikely to keep pace with demand. Ice trays won't be much help either as they generally take hours to freeze a small batch. Now with an ice maker, you can have a new batch of ice in minutes rather than hours. Many even include storage bins, ensuring a surplus of ice for any occasion. Features: 1. Portable design: Simoe portable ice maker can be used in a kitchen or den, in tiny homes, RVs or camping trailers, or even follow the family outside to a BBQ if there’s an outdoor kitchen with the appropriate electrical hookups. 2. Two Ice Sizes Selectable: Large or Small Size. Meet different needs. This countertop ice maker makes bullet ice cubes. Bullet ice cubes cool drinks quickly and are ideal for blended drinks, followed by being suitable for chewing. 3. Fast ice making: Instead of waiting hours to get a batch of ice from the freezer, this ice maker can make 9 bullets of ice in 8 minutes. 26lbs ice cube /24 hours. 4. R600a High-Efficiency Compressor: 33lbs in 24 Hours. This ice maker that offers 33 lbs of storage will allow you to make about 100 cup drinks. 5. 3.3lbs ice capacity, if you can't use all of them, you can add them to a plastic bag and store them in the fridge. 6. Simoe ice makers offer a self-cleaning feature, which can help ensure crystal clear cubes with lots of crunch. 7. Infrared Sensor Technology: Ice Full and Add Water indicator. 8. Anti-fingerprints Stainless Steel: ABS appearance is easy to stain. 9. Recycling: This ice machine will recycle that melted water into the next batch of ice, so the water will not be wasted.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b5yRvlFsL._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIMOE","source_asin":"B09JLPBHWS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-145212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JLPBHWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JLPBHWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
