window.products.push({"id":145352,"name":"N/Q Stainless Steel Refillable Coffee Capsules, Reusable Coffee Pods, Coffee Filters Compatible for Nespresso Vertuoline Vertuo Plus Machines,Capsule","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DZaWj-Z1L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Features:Precise coffee filter makes your coffee taste more strong and smooth.Rich in oil and delicate in taste, can freely fill your favorite coffee powder.Specifications:Material: Food Grade Stainless Steel CapsuleCapacity: 9g coffeeCoffee Ground Size: FINE and MEDIUM Espresso GrindsBrewing Espresso Volume: 70ml(2.5oz)Compatible with: for Nespresso Vertuoline GCA1,Delonghi ENV135 series,VertuoPlus BNV450WHT1BUC1 series and VertuoPlus De'Longhi ENV150 series.In order to help you use it efficiently, we need to provide some notes when processing:Q.: Why is my coffee weak?A.: Check your grind and/or tamping! When the coffee grind is too coarse, and/or if the tamping is too loose, then coffee can be too weak.Q.: Why does too little coffee come out?A: 1) Press the coffee too tight; 2)too Fine coffee grinds; 3)the water outlet or the filter net is blocked. Please get pod and adjust.Q.: If your machine showing red light, please get pod and check at first:A.: Reopen the machine and check the following: 1. The capsule's holes are not clogged. 2. Coffee that is ground too fine will block the capsule's holes. 3. Coffee that is packed too loosely--make sure to add four level scoops and tamp tightly.Skill From Practice: To confirm the best result of our pods,you could fill the capsule with the contents of an original Nespresso pod, press it tightly to brew a nice cup to check. After that you will know more about the amount of coffee as well as the fineness/coarseness of the grind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DZaWj-Z1L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N/Q","source_asin":"B08LQNLCH1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-145352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LQNLCH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LQNLCH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
