window.products.push({"id":145417,"name":"H&H 12-3/4\" Long Heating Element Electric Dryer for Frigidaire FASE7073NR2, FASE7073NR3, FASE7073NW0, FASE7073NW2, FASE7073NW3, FASE7074LA0, etc.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41L4XKnxFkL._AC_.jpg","description":"This part # 134792700 is a heater, but may also be known as a heating element, and it is meant for your dryer. This is where the heat is generated during your machine cycle in order to properly dry your clothing. This model is a 5500 watt, and has three coils. Specifications: - Dryer heating element assembly. Produces heat while the dryer is in operation.- Material: Metal / Ceramic. Element is strung with a coiled wire made of a nickel and a chrome alloy.- Electrical Specs: 240V, 5500 Watt 3 coil element with housing.- Overall Dimensions: 12-3/4\"L x 6-5/8\"W x 5-3/8\"H.- Additional Dimensions: Housing measures 5\" diameter. This part fixes the following symptoms: - No heat or not enough heat- Shuts off too soon- Will Not Start- Takes too long to dry If the dryer does not heat check for a blown themal fuse or thermal cut out. Heating elements will often have a break in the coil element if defective. For this repair you will need a number two square bit, a screwdriver, and a flat-head screwdriver. Does not include thermostat or thermal fuse. Note: Any use of the OEM brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. This is a generic product and not an OEM product and is not covered under any OEM manufacturer's warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41L4XKnxFkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H&H","source_asin":"B07NQH281B","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-145417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NQH281B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NQH281B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
