window.products.push({"id":145482,"name":"Beaquicy DC64-00519D Door Lock Switch OEM replacement exact fit Samsung washer model wf42h5200aw, wa48j7700aw/a2, wv55m9600av/a5, wf45n5300av/us","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jVYFnYzYL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"【𝑫𝑪𝟔𝟒-𝟎𝟎𝟓𝟏𝟗𝑫 𝑾𝑨𝑺𝑯𝑬𝑹 𝑫𝑶𝑶𝑹 𝑳𝑶𝑪𝑲 𝑺𝑾𝑰𝑻𝑪𝑯】: The DC64-00519D Door Lock Switch is a front-loading washing machine door lock switch assembly. The DC64-00519D Washer Door lock switch locks the washer door to prevent the door from opening during the wash cycle and the spin cycle. The package includes 1 x DC64-00519D Washer Door Lock Switch. This is a new GENUINE replacement part. It is an OEM product, which is stronger and more durable and lasts longer than non-OEM products. 【𝑨𝑩𝑺 𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑺𝑻𝑰𝑪】: The DC64-00519D Washer Door Lock Switch is made of high quality ABS plastic material with good durability and solidity. It is an OEM product and has been strictly inspected and tested by the manufacturer to ensure long-term effective operation. If switch is broken, the washer will have the FOLLOWING CONDITIONS, and the switch need to be replaced in time: ➤Washer was making noise. ➤Door lock would not unlock. ➤The door opens when the washer is running. ➤Washer leaks. 【𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】: The DC64-00519D Washer Door Lock Switch Assembly support 365 DAYS return and exchange. ➤The DC64-00519D washing machine door lock switch assembly is made from ultra-durable, high quality ABS plastic that can withstand long-term wear and tear. The high quality plastic makes the door lock switch tougher and less likely to break if dropped accidentally. However, please pick it up and put it down securely for a sense of experience. 【𝑾𝑰𝑫𝑬 𝑪𝑶𝑴𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑩𝑰𝑳𝑬】: The Door Lock Switch of DC64-00519D can replacement for Sam-Sung washer. Replaces Numbers: DC97-16899A, DC6400519D, AP6027082, 4545806, PS11762120, EAP11762120. ➤Compatible: WV55M9600AV/A5-00, WF45K6500AV/A2-00, WF45N5300AV/US-00, WF45M5500AP/A5-00, WF45M5500AW/A5-00, WF45M5500AZ/A5-00, WF45K6200AZ/A2-00, WF45K6200AZ/A2-01, WF50K7500AV/A2-00, WF50K7500AV/A2-11, WV55M9600AW/A5-03, WF206BNW/XAA, WF42H5200AF/A2, WF42H5600AP/A2, etc. 【𝑬𝑨𝑺𝒀 𝑻𝑶 𝑰𝑵𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑳𝑳】: The installation of DC64-00519D Samsung Switch Door Lock is easy. Wearing work gloves, locate the switch door lock, remove the old one and replace it with a new one. Connecting the new door lock to the wire in the switch position makes it to receive the locking signal sent by the washer and enables the door to be locked securely. NOTE: Please ensure that the new replacement door lock switch is in good condition when installing to avoid useless work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jVYFnYzYL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0859CMRP6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-145482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0859CMRP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0859CMRP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
