window.products.push({"id":145797,"name":"50 PCS Large Cold Brew Coffee Filters, 18\" x 22\" Filter Bags for Cold Brew Coffee, fits 5 Gallon Commercial Cold Brew Systems, Cold Brew Bags Disposab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ko-SboM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% COMPATIBLE:Large commercial coffee filter measures 18\"*20\" and brews 5 lbs of coffee. Perfectly compatible with large filter 5 gallon buckets and other 5 gallon coffee sock commercial systems, the cold brew coffee filter is ideal for brewing cold brew coffee in both commercial and home environments. STTONGEST COFFEE FILTER BAGS:Commercial cold brew coffee filters are made of thicker non-woven material that easily captures all the fine impurities, oils and bitterness in the coffee without causing any changes in the extraction or flavor of the final product, making the coffee taste better. These disposable cold brew filters are the strongest seamless filter bags ever made, and every coffee lover should have them! DISPOSABLE AND MESS-FREE:Nylon mesh bags and metal filters can be tedious to clean, while potentially sending an abundance of costly and environmentally unfriendly detergents down the drain. Cold-brew coffee filters are rip-resistant, flavorless, disposable, and biodegradable, trapping all impurities, oils, and bitter elements. No strainer is required.“It’s what got you into specialty coffee,” WIDE APPLICATIONS: These cold brews filter bag can be used not only at home but also in cafes, restaurants, or other workplaces; you can use our cold brew coffee filters whenever you need them. Our disposable commercial coffee filters can help you reduce operating costs and increase productivity while ensuring your coffee tastes great. 100% SATISFFACTION PROMISE：If you don't love it, we'll give you your money back. We love the difference this filter makes. Not only are you reusing your filter, but you're also creating a totally different flavor profile than you would get with paper or metal filters. Cloth filters allow more oils through and therefore give you more body - without sacrificing complexity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ko-SboM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOCOOS","source_asin":"B0BNVCKGFR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-145797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNVCKGFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNVCKGFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
